# GS-004: Warm water retains a smaller fraction of a finite CO2 dose
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL @ 20C
seal v1 500mL
add v1 CO2 0.002mol
measure v1 pressure
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 100mL @ 50C
seal v2 500mL
add v2 CO2 0.002mol
measure v2 pressure
inspect v2
